A. Commit message:
Fixed CVE-2024-45231 -- Avoided server error on password reset when email sending fails.

B. Change summary:
Added a try-except block around the email sending logic in the `send_mail` method of `PasswordResetForm`. If an exception occurs during email sending, it is logged instead of causing a server error. Updated the documentation to reflect the changes and added a test case to verify the behavior.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
